{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HopcroftKarpEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Edge"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Edge"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each phase starts with a breadth-first search from the free left vertices, alternating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unmatched and matched edges, that finds the length of the shortest augmenting paths; it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reported with that length. Then depth-first searches from each free left vertex, in left"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order, find a maximal set of vertex-disjoint shortest augmenting paths, each reported as it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"found and applied: its edges, from the free left vertex to a free right vertex, alternate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"between unmatched ones, which join the matching, and matched ones, which leave it. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"algorithm ends when a search finds no augmenting path."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/matchingmodule\/hopcroftkarpevent"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MatchingModule\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/MatchingModule\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/MatchingModule\/SQ","doc:\/\/MatchingModule\/s9Esca